{"speciesId":382,"names":{"fr":"Kyogre","es":"Kyogre","en":"Kyogre","ja":"カイオーガ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"KYOGRE has the power to create massive rain clouds that cover the entire sky and bring about torrential downpours. This POKéMON saved people who were suffering from droughts."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"KYOGRE is named in mythology as the POKéMON that expanded the sea by covering the land with torrential rains and towering tidal waves. It took to sleep after a cataclysmic battle with GROUDON."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"KYOGRE has appeared in mythology as the creator of the sea. After long years of feuding with GROUDON, it took to sleep at the bottom of the sea."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"This POKéMON is said to have expanded the sea by bringing heavy rains. It has the power to control water."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"This POKéMON is said to have expanded the sea by bringing heavy rains. It has the power to control water."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"A mythical Pokémon said to have swelled the seas with rain and tidal waves. It battled with GROUDON."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"A mythical Pokémon said to have swelled the seas with rain and tidal waves. It battled with GROUDON."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit qu’il a fait monter les eaux en causant des pluies diluviennes. Il somnolait dans une fosse marine."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On dit qu’il a fait monter les eaux en causant des pluies diluviennes. Il somnolait dans une fosse marine."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ennemi juré de Groudon, la légende dit qu’il a étendu les mers en causant déluges et raz de marée."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon legendario que aumentó los mares con diluvios y maremotos. Fue un enemigo acérrimo de Groudon."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A mythical Pokémon said to have swelled the seas with rain and tidal waves. It battled with Groudon."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大雨と 大津波で 海を 広げた 神話の ポケモン。 グラードンと 激しく 戦った。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On dit qu’il a fait monter les eaux en causant des pluies diluviennes. Il somnolait dans une fosse marine."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se dice que aumentó el nivel del mar a base de aguaceros. Ha estado durmiendo en una fosa marina."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大雨を 降らせる 能力で 海を 広げたと 言われている。 海溝の 底で 眠っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Grâce à l’énergie de la nature, il peut accomplir sa Primo-Résurgence pour retrouver son apparence originelle. Ce pouvoir lui permet d’appeler de terribles déluges pour étendre les mers."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kyogre se sirve de la energía de la naturaleza para realizar su Regresión Primigenia y recobrar su apariencia primitiva. Con tal poder, puede desencadenar tempestades para expandir los océanos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Through Primal Reversion and with nature’s full power, it will take back its true form. It can summon storms that cause the sea levels to rise."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"自然のエネルギーに よって ゲンシカイキし 本来の 姿を 取り戻す。その力は 嵐を 呼び寄せ 海を 広げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon considéré comme l’avatar des océans. Selon les légendes, il a disputé de nombreux combats avec Groudon pour contrôler l’énergie de la nature."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Kyogre siempre se le ha descrito como el Pokémon que expandió los océanos. Varias leyendas cuentan que libró combates contra Groudon en repetidas ocasiones para tener el control de la energía de la naturaleza."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kyogre is said to be the personification of the sea itself. Legends tell of its many clashes against Groudon, as each sought to gain the power of nature."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"海の 化身 と 伝わる ポケモン。 自然のエネルギーを 求めて グラードンと 争いを 繰り返したという 伝説が ある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":382,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[5,"level-up",20],[6,"level-up",20],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",20],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",20],[9,"level-up",20],[10,"level-up",15],[11,"level-up",15],[12,"level-up",20],[13,"level-up",20],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[5,"level-up",65],[6,"level-up",65],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",65],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",65],[9,"level-up",65],[10,"level-up",80],[11,"level-up",80],[